	(text "For drive, enable the DAC path and release its ground clamp; for GND, do the\nopposite. All 32 optional 1M BL bleeders are DNP to avoid unmeasured WRITE\nreturn current. With both switches OFF, a BL may float. Use BL_ZERO for a\ndefined level or deliberate discharge. The 10k resistors bias control pins only."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 315 62.306 0)
		(effects
